  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b79c892de0dd1d02b0fe3008986e72270645112fc462576b07d63baa2c27d1d",
      "text": "爱情剧拍摄的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25756c5de989682c2f055804c8c720b340427ee87f12e29760313232e1ad8678",
      "text": "翔真先生，让您久等了。\n这是这次要出演的爱情剧的剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d45ad70be2c9e85ccc98e5c5722280bc03538ce976d1972413bfe45a7f30fdb",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n我的角色是商社职员对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d71ff6bb6ef77faa8378ff58c80c90c4d693bf0c676f7d7bef081ebb1a30ff2",
      "text": "能穿什么样的西装也很让人期待呢♪\n毕竟这次还跟西装品牌进行了联动合作呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85fbc6f73183b114695ddcf89081b86a97ce6fe986706931fa6e40fbb79d6418",
      "text": "据说近期就要去量尺寸了。\n具体日程敲定后，我会通知您的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a59c1fe9ed654695f2e1787104d38ee4b05a7f3502fbabdd557a2d0859f88a",
      "text": "拜托你啦。……我先来确认一下剧本。\n能稍微等我一会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2786f3e864a2c73897fb11c9467b480fe5161091e09ebf7a4cad0120e30ffff5",
      "text": "久等了。剧情主线和恋爱要素交织在一起，\n剧本非常有趣呢。真是部好作品啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290fee787198fd5fa1e50469fb18af72e5b14fdcb5c23ffe8e812340aa508112",
      "text": "翔真先生要演的角色感觉如何？\n因为是爱情剧，据说这次选角特意追求了反差感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0713ca59dbfec4f8579f199e7e9aa2590bb919b8295cd7859036018eae1af5c3",
      "text": "这种角色我很擅长哦。\n读剧本的时候，我都能提前猜到角色的心思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f9c795aeca146e51df7819ba2169c901820f09d1f1b4526ed125f1be60cf704",
      "text": "那真是太好了。\n到正式开拍之前，一起努力练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b09794d18f5dbbcd56dcca587f12e77062d9cfd235cd16666a436a3bf806bc4",
      "text": "嗯，直到杀青都要同心协力哦。\n就靠你啦，●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
